stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Trialing: applyFreePlan / registration
  Trialing: Broad sandbox features (0112 parity)
  Trialing: Low plan limits still enforced
  Trialing --> Active: status ACTIVE + free_sandbox_expires_at set
  Active --> Expired: free-sandbox-expiry.job\nexpires_at < now
  Expired: lock_reason = free_sandbox_expired
  Expired --> ReadOnly: GET tenant APIs OK
  ReadOnly --> WriteBlocked: POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE → 402
  ReadOnly --> BillingOK: /api/billing/* still allowed
  Expired --> Active: upgrade OR admin extend-free-trial
  Active --> Paid: checkout / admin plan change\n(silver, gold, platinum)
  Paid --> [*]
